@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@
+# Self-hosting Fizzy
+
+Fizzy includes a Kamal configuration for running a complete instance on a single
+Linux server: one container with Rails, SQLite, and Solid Queue, plus TLS from
+the Kamal proxy.
+
+See the [deployment guide](deployment.md) for the full walkthrough, including:
+
+- filling in your hostname and mail server in `config/deploy.yml`,
+- filling in your secrets in `.kamal/secrets`,
+- running `bin/kamal setup` to bring up Fizzy at `https://your-host`,
+- the persistent `fizzy:/rails/storage` volume that keeps SQLite data and
+  uploads across deploys.
